      117  According to the government's Economic Planning Board, the population density will be 530 people per square kilometer by 2023, the year the population is expected to stabilize. [ 29 ]
      118  Rural areas in South Korea consist of agglomerated villages in river valleys and range from a few houses to several hundred. [ 30 ] These villages are located in the south that are backed by hills and give strong protection from winter winds. [ 30 ]
